#: modtstudioimport:rsdescription
msgid ""
"Imports a BTT-Writer project package (.tstudio) into the BTT-Writer projects "
"folder. Check first: it tells you whether the project is new or already "
"here, and which chunks a merge would leave in conflict."
msgstr ""

